### Gateway Endpoints - Test Requests

### Base URL for local development
@baseUrl = http://localhost:22271

### 1. Get user data (requires authentication)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/user
Accept: application/json

### 2. Initiate login (redirects to OIDC provider)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/login

### 3. Initiate logout (redirects to OIDC provider)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### 4. Test frontend route (should work without authentication)
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: text/html

### 5. Test API systemstatus route
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/systemstatus
Accept: application/json

### 6. Test health check endpoint (should work without authentication)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: text/plain
